      "writtenOn": "2024-01-30T19:26:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was originally thinking of a use case where we have an existing pipeline / pipeline state, want to use a different subpass to load MSAA from resolve, then want to continue using the prior pipeline for whatever reason (like a drawpass command that triggers loading from MSAA on the Vulkan backend, but then simply receiving more draw commands without an explicit draw pass command to bind back the old pipeline). We actually probably don\u0027t need to actually (nor have a reason to) support that though given that loading from MSAA has a different pipeline key and therefore triggers a different pipeline to be bound anyways.\n\nRemoved!",
      "parentUuid": "633e4bed_fafc291d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 680,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 680,
        "endChar": 84
